h character exists, then print . There will always be a valid solution, and any correct answer is acceptable. For example, if  \"bcbc\", we can either remove 'b' at index  or 'c' at index .  Input Format  The first line contains an integer, , denoting the number of test cases.  Each line  of the  subsequent lines (where ) describes a test case in the form of a single string, .  Constraints  All characters are lowercase English letters. Output Format  Print an integer denoting the zero-indexed position of the character that makes  not a palindrome; if  is already a palindrome or no such character exists, print .  Sample Input  3 aaab baa aaa Sample Output  3 0 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":229630,"global_rank":113558},{"name":"Vilin97/plasmos-demo","owner":"Vilin97","html_url":"https://github.com/Vilin97/plasmos-demo","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229627,"global_rank":113565},{"name":"arpjw/sentiment-playground","owner":"arpjw","html_url":"https://github.com/arpjw/sentiment-playground","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"experimenting with sentiment analysis","topics":[],"score":229627,"global_rank":113578},{"name":"Tatianaob/algorithm_visualizer","owner":"Tatianaob","html_url":"https://github.com/Tatianaob/algorithm_visualizer","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229627,"global_rank":113581},{"name":"maskaravivek/sonarqube-python-code-coverage-circleci","owner":"ma